  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'YOUR MISSION (WHAT YOU MUST DO): The owner hid a master override switch
    inside this house that can deactivate and restore the grid. You must search the
    house and solve a series of environmental riddles that get harder as you go.
    Each solved riddle will lead you closer to the override button. You have no AI
    assistance you must rely entirely on your own brain to get to the switch and
    turn the power back on.


    RIDDLE ONE

    I was shaped by human hands to
    hold living beauty, yet I stand hollow and still.

    Like humanity, I have
    forgotten my true purpose holding life only when filled by another.

    Note:Each
    object has a hidden number to open a safe.'
